  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "TEXT_INTROCUTION",
      "sequenceNr": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "I have been engaged in IT Service Management, Service Design, and the operation of business-critical systems in the banking and financial sector for more than 15 years."
        },
        {
          "text": "During my tenure at UBS, bob Finance, and as CTO of a technology start-up, I have designed, built, operated, and continuously evolved complex IT services across their entire lifecycle. My focus lies in bridging business requirements, stable IT processes, and sustainable service structures."
        },
        {
          "text": "I possess extensive experience in Service Design, Service Ownership, stakeholder management, process optimisation, KPI and quality management, as well as in operating highly available applications and IT infrastructures. Through my long-standing work in the banking sector, I am intimately familiar with the requirements for stability, compliance, security, and operational excellence."
        },
        {
          "text": "My strength lies in combining technical and business perspectives, communicating complex relationships clearly, and successfully implementing sustainable solutions with diverse stakeholder groups."
        }
      ]
    },
